      "reasons": [
        "The packet describes the EMOTICOM instrument as a “comprehensive neuropsychological test battery” consisting of 11 tasks, but it does not support the more general claim that a “test battery” is broadly “a set of multiple tests or tasks used together to assess a range of related abilities or processes.”",
        "The packet supports that the EMOTICOM test battery is designed to assess “hot cognition” (emotionally salient information), but the definition’s first sentence contains unverified generalizations not stated in the provided text."
